    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_025-33a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-04-28T23:51:52.087+09:00">whom they resent.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-22a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2020-05-14T21:05:50.422+09:00">Eben, sag ich doch, dass ist doch nicht der Mozi</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_021-26a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-05-22T21:10:43.487+09:00">was able thereby to become...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_002-21a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-05-25T22:25:06.923+09:00">With their ears they cannot hear</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_002-21a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-05-25T22:25:15.789+09:00">with their eyes they cannot see</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_002-21a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-05-25T22:25:59.923+09:00">with their mouths they cannot eat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_022-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-06-11T18:43:33.702+09:00">wanted to have him too killed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_016-36a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-06-26T17:19:31.751+09:00">As a matter of principle misrule</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_016-36a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-06-26T17:20:24.272+09:00">is because punishments and honorary titles are not adequately deployed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_020-15a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2021-07-12T18:20:11.845+09:00">human individuals</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_013-27a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2023-08-02T07:54:38.085+09:00">is that not absurdly unrealistic?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_017-12a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2023-09-17T17:57:09.467+09:00">In this way this maintains that ears, eyes, mind and intelligence are not sufficient to RELY on:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_017-12a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2023-09-17T17:56:30.231+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:05:39.66+09:00">As for the basic nature of water, it is to be pure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:07:07.595+09:00">As for the basic/inborn nature of man, it is to be long-lived.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:35:31.203+09:00">Dirty dusty&gt;dirty things will soil the water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:40:22.303+09:00">unless he is very lucky is bound to be ruined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T05:49:42.43+09:00">So then, this discussion of this deserves to be more closely investigated! 【Chen Qiyou considers the reference of the object 之: 高注：”論此上句貴賤禍福不可不察。“ “句”字當衍，蓋此上皆論貴富禍福，不僅數句而已。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:33:14.931+09:00">What in the beginning gave life to living things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:34:48.683+09:00">was Heaven [all old editions have "Heaven and Earth"];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:34:06.951+09:00">what nurtured and successfully cultivated them </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:34:39.039+09:00">was man;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:36:42.476+09:00">he who is capable of cultivating what Heaven has given life to and does not interfere with it is the Son of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:38:00.016+09:00">When the Son of Heaven takes action</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:49:47.34+09:00">this is of the sort that is designed to ensure the integrity of Heaven:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:51:01.833+09:00">it is with this motivation that Heaven establishes administrative offices,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:53:01.579+09:00">and as for the establishment of administrative offices, this is designed to maintain the integrity of the living.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:03:45.913+09:00">When the confused rulership in our times</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:05:03.499+09:00">has a plethora of administrative offices but on the contrary uses them to harm the living</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:06:43.93+09:00">then they will lose what they established these administrative offices for.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:28:54.333+09:00">how can one's natural potential fail to be damaged.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:31:35.535+09:00">if one considers something to be beneficial to one's natural potential</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:32:44.28+09:00">if one considers something to be harmful to one's natural potential then opts against it</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:34:14.509+09:00">this is one's method of keeping one's natural potential intact.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:39:33.635+09:00">If ten thousand men, wielding their bows, shoot</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:39:42.726+09:00">at one and the same target,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:40:54.728+09:00">that target will never fail to be hit (by some of them)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:47:30.127+09:00">if ten thousand objects gleam in their splendour</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:44:13.216+09:00">so as to harm one and the same single life</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:45:03.061+09:00">that life will never fail to be harmed; </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:48:03.135+09:00">but if (these ten thousand things gleam in their splendour) so as to facilitate one and the same single life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:49:38.844+09:00">then no life will fail to thrive for long.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:50:34.247+09:00">Therefore the sage's management of all kinds of things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:51:42.727+09:00">is designed to keep intact what is (received) from Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:52:54.555+09:00">When what is from Heaven is intact then one's spirit is well-attuned</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:53:21.793+09:00">one's eyes are clear-sighted,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:53:45.202+09:00">one's ears are sharp of hearing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:57:56.521+09:00">then one's nose has a keen sense of smell</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:58:18.941+09:00">then one's mouth has a keen sense of taste</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:00:31.429+09:00">Such a person</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:00:43.712+09:00">will be trusted without even speaking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:05:50.414+09:00">will hit the mark without even planning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:06:23.095+09:00">will get things right without even thinking;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:08:06.033+09:00">his spermal essence pervades Heaven and Earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:09:00.589+09:00">his spirit englobes all time and space.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:09:51.17+09:00">in his relation to things he is never less than receptive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T20:11:52.29+09:00">he is never less than embracing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:16:17.868+09:00">in a manner like that of Heaven and Earth.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
